Detailed Explanation:
Uses fallback logic - tries multiple data sources in order: {{
  $json.urls && typeof $json.urls === "string" && $json.urls.trim() !== ""
    ? (
        $json.urls.startsWith("/") || $json.urls.startsWith("./")
          ? $('Transform to JSON').item.json["Url"].split("/").slice(0,3).join("/") + "/" + $json.urls.replace(/^\.?\//,"").trim()
          : $json.urls.startsWith("#")
            ? $('Transform to JSON').item.json["Url"].split("/").slice(0,3).join("/") + "/" + $json.urls.trim()
            : $json.urls.trim()
      )
    : null
}}

Retrieves the '"
    ]
  }
]' field from the JSON data of the previous node
